  "description": "Optional add-on for League of Legends Heroes: Senna's Absolution as in League - the Mist she gathers (attack, range and critical chance) is kept through death. The data pack cannot carry anything over a death (the game clears every buff), so there her Mist starts again each life; this add-on remembers every Mist layer and puts them back the moment death clears them. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
